This product includes software developed for "Investigación Base 12", a
research project on dozenal (base 12) arithmetic in which every arithmetic
operation is composed from 12-valued logic gates, with no native integer
arithmetic applied to a dozenal value at any point.

Original source: https://github.com/Javierzv777/base-12-calculator

